  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To reduce mortality and morbidity of the 62,644 conflict-affected women, men, girls and boys in Aden governorate in Yemen through life-saving Health, Protection and WASH intervention increase the most vulnerable people&#x2019;s access to basic services of food and to contribute to increasing the ability of vulnerable families to withstand shocks by improving access to livelihood opportunities and increasing the income of the targeted family in Sallah District - Taiz Governorate.</narrative>
